[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19503.27, "timestamp": "05:25:03", "text": "没有鬼。好的。 EMF5，对吧？呃，我不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19505.43, "timestamp": "05:25:05", "text": "确定是EMF5。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19508.628, "timestamp": "05:25:08", "text": "我点击了恶魔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19512.788, "timestamp": "05:25:12", "text": "是的。哦，它已经为你准备好了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19515.11, "timestamp": "05:25:15", "text": "我们走吧。因为他狩猎得太早了。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19520.31, "timestamp": "05:25:20", "text": "已经为了破事儿追猎太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19525.07, "timestamp": "05:25:25", "text": "恶魔超级可怕，因为它会像猎杀动物一样捕猎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19529.83, "timestamp": "05:25:29", "text": "呃，非常非常频繁。非常频繁。啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19531.59, "timestamp": "05:25:31", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19543.67, "timestamp": "05:25:43", "text": "游戏。两场比赛。是的。两个，对吧？曾是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19546.868, "timestamp": "05:25:46", "text": "两个？哪一个？三场比赛。我们做到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19548.948, "timestamp": "05:25:48", "text": "三。我想我们，是的，我们做了三个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19551.59, "timestamp": "05:25:51", "text": "游戏。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19553.76, "timestamp": "05:25:53", "text": "是的， 很有趣。我通常不玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19556.558, "timestamp": "05:25:56", "text": "很有趣。我通常不玩 恐便症，因为我觉得它太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19559.44, "timestamp": "05:25:59", "text": "恐便症，因为我觉得它太…… 可怕的。是啊，太可怕了。但非常"}]